  "description": "This package contains the Background Jobs module of the Endatix Platform. It provides a durable, generic job queue for long-running tenant operations: the BackgroundJobs table is the queue, a sweeper discovers eligible rows, and a bounded runner claims and executes them with retry and dead-lettering held on the job row. Persistence lives in its own \"jobs\" schema with its own migration history, so job migrations deploy independently of app-schema migrations.\n\n      Endatix Platform is an open-source data collection and management library for .NET.",
